# Generated by replay.severity.register_base(): the pinned rulebook with upstream's severity
# patch applied. DERIVED, never authored — regenerated whenever the pin or the patch moves,
# and committing it would create a second copy of the rulebook that can silently go stale.
src/replay/severity_data/auto_mode_severity.txt

# The redline figure theme -- WORKING, and deliberately UNBLESSED. It re-themes the gallery into
# its own figures/redline/out/ and never writes figures/out/, so `./check replay` stays green while
# it exists. But nothing tracked imports it, it has no MANIFEST row, and it vendors nine IBM Plex
# .ttf files -- so blessing it is an M-1 call that drags M-11 in with it, because the NOTICE would
# then have to name IBM Corp, the copyright HOLDER, not just "IBM Plex". Ignored so that decision
# gets made on purpose rather than by whoever next runs `bin/land`. Blessing it deletes this line
# in the same commit. See MANIFEST.md, "Does not travel".
figures/redline/
